common_sampler_sample read the backend logits/probs/candidates rows into
cur_p before checking whether a backend sampler already picked the token.
Check the token first and build cur_p only when
common_sampler_get_candidates() asks for it (n_probs, speculative
decoding). LLAMA_BACKEND_SAMPLING_LAZY_READBACK=0 keeps the eager build.
